ID: B3-Ch09b-Invent
TEXT:

#if(v_b3_ch9_teleport != 1) {
While Flower keeps the king pinned under a steady barrage of fire, I drop into the opening stance of the lightning spell. I trace the exact same arcs as before—until the final third, where a sharp inward twist of my left wrist redirects the mana flow entirely, shifting the payload.

Peter focuses entirely on my first two hand positions. He locks into the reverse sequence, planting his feet to absorb the expected lightning bolt.

The altered shock snaps from my fingers, blasting through his guard. The current scorches the edge of his magical barrier and sends him reeling, muscles seizing in violent spasms before he catches his balance.

"You... altered the form!" Peter presses a glowing hand to his chest, weaving a quick healing charm. "How did you—"

"For the love of the gods, Peter!" the king shouts over the roar of Flower's flames. "The man just told you he created the technique, and you walked straight into the counter? What were you thinking?"

"He created nothing!" Peter snarls. "It is Brinhorn's dispelling method! The name is on the scroll!"

}
#if(v_b3_ch9_teleport == 1) {
While the Overseer maintains its steady stream of fire against the king, I drop into the opening stance of the lightning spell. I trace the exact same arcs as before—until the final third, where a sharp inward twist of my left wrist redirects the mana flow entirely, shifting the payload.

Peter focuses entirely on my first two hand positions. He locks into the reverse sequence, planting his feet to absorb the expected lightning bolt.

The altered shock snaps from my fingers, blasting through his guard. The current scorches the edge of his magical barrier and sends him reeling, muscles seizing in violent spasms before he catches his balance.

"You... altered the form!" Peter presses a glowing hand to his chest, weaving a quick healing charm. "How did you—"

"For the love of the gods, Peter!" the king shouts over the drone's roaring beam. "The man just told you he created the technique, and you walked straight into the counter? What were you thinking?"

"He created nothing!" Peter snarls. "It is Brinhorn's dispelling method! The name is on the scroll!"

}
#if(v_b3_ch9_element == 0) {
"I care nothing for who signed the manual—cease using it!" the king barks. "You are an ethereal and a generalist. Engage him with something beyond basic cancellations!"

"As you say," Peter mutters, completing the stitch over his singed chest. "Let us see how he manages something less predictable."

His hands blur into intricate, overlapping glyphs, drawing an immense mass of power into the space between his palms. The sequence matches one of the nastiest area spells in standard theory: fifty seeking fireballs designed to track a designated target until impact.

I move instantly, running the entire particle flow in reverse. My first time deploying the Brinhorn counter against a high-tier offensive spell under live pressure; my fingers slip on the fifth transition, but I accelerate through the final sweep, snapping the reverse anchor shut just as the first flaming orbs ignite.

The fireballs collapse into pale ash. Seizing the opening, I channel Flower's fire drills, hurling three rapid incendiary bolts across the gap.

}
#if(v_b3_ch9_element == 1) {
"I care nothing for who signed the manual—cease using it!" the king barks. "You are an ethereal and a generalist. Engage him with something beyond basic cancellations!"

