I move instantly, running the entire particle flow in reverse. My first time deploying the Brinhorn counter against a high-tier offensive spell under live pressure; my fingers slip on the fifth transition, but I accelerate through the final sweep, snapping the reverse anchor shut just as the first flaming orbs ignite.

The fireballs collapse into pale ash. Seizing the opening, I channel Melindra's wind techniques, launching three razor-sharp air blades in rapid succession.

}
#if(v_b3_ch9_element == 3) {
"I care nothing for who signed the manual—cease using it!" the king barks. "You are an ethereal and a generalist. Engage him with something beyond basic cancellations!"

"As you say," Peter mutters, completing the stitch over his singed chest. "Let us see how he manages something less predictable."

His hands blur into intricate, overlapping glyphs, drawing an immense mass of power into the space between his palms. The sequence matches one of the nastiest area spells in standard theory: fifty seeking fireballs designed to track a designated target until impact.

I move instantly, running the entire particle flow in reverse. My first time deploying the Brinhorn counter against a high-tier offensive spell under live pressure; my fingers slip on the fifth transition, but I accelerate through the final sweep, snapping the reverse anchor shut just as the first flaming orbs ignite.

The fireballs collapse into pale ash. Seizing the opening, I channel Kate's ice drills, launching three jagged icicles straight at his torso.

}
The offensive cuts short. Fifty blazing orbs reignite in a wide circle around me, roaring with renewed heat despite the clean dispel.

I ignite my air currents and launch upward, banking hard to put distance between myself and the swarm.

"You cannot outrun them," Peter calls out as the fireballs bank into my slipstream, closing the distance. "If you know the reverse form, you know the design. They will track you across the breadth of this plane. There is no escape."

Fifty simultaneous detonations will blast through any earth or ice barrier I can muster with basic forms. That was why I dispelled it. But the sequence closed cleanly; I broke the core. Why are fifty fireballs still locked onto my wake?

