ID: B3-Ch09b-Engagement
TEXT:

#if(v_b3_ch9_teleport != 1) {
"Diagnostic indicates tactical distress in your current engagement," the Overseer's monotone cuts through the rush of wind. "Do you require operational assistance?"

The green-eyed drone drifts level with my shoulder, effortlessly weaving between incoming fireballs without breaking its smooth glide.

"Yes!" I yell, banking hard left as three flaming spheres scorch past my ribs. "Assistance! Intervene!"

}
#if(v_b3_ch9_teleport == 1) {
"Diagnostic indicates tactical distress in your current engagement," the Overseer's monotone cuts through the rush of wind. "Do you require operational assistance?"

Across the glare, Flower keeps the king under a steady hail of fire, while the green-eyed drone matches my flight path, drifting through the fireballs without a single erratic twitch.

"Yes!" I yell, banking hard left as three flaming spheres scorch past my ribs. "Assistance! Intervene!"

}
#if(v_b3_ch2_name == 0) {
"Request confirmed," the drone states, banking gracefully through the trailing smoke. "Initiating extraction protocol. Note that experimental ethereal procedures remain restricted due to safety protocols governing party 'Felran, the strongest fire elementalist on the Eastern Continent'. For performance inquiries, consult section 5C-E789 of the Overseer operating manual. Thank you for your cooperation."

"Fine, keep the experimental stuff locked!" I shout. "Just clear the field!"

"Acknowledged. Standard countermeasure deploying in T-minus five seconds. Have a pleasant day."

An emerald pulse washes over the battlefield. In a single clean snap, every tracking fireball dissolves into nothing.

Peter lowers his hands, stunned.

"How did you clear a sustained projectile spell post-ignition?" I demand, wheeling around the drone.

"Your premise is flawed," the Overseer says. "The protocol performed no dispelling sequence. Utilizing parameters derived from the Magium, I suspended local ethereal matter manipulation."

}
#if(v_b3_ch2_name == 1) {
"Request confirmed," the drone states, banking gracefully through the trailing smoke. "Initiating extraction protocol. Note that experimental ethereal procedures remain restricted due to safety protocols governing party 'Cutthroat Dave'. For performance inquiries, consult section 5C-E789 of the Overseer operating manual. Thank you for your cooperation."

"Fine, keep the experimental stuff locked!" I shout. "Just clear the field!"

"Acknowledged. Standard countermeasure deploying in T-minus five seconds. Have a pleasant day."

An emerald pulse washes over the battlefield. In a single clean snap, every tracking fireball dissolves into nothing.

Peter lowers his hands, stunned.

"How did you clear a sustained projectile spell post-ignition?" I demand, wheeling around the drone.

"Your premise is flawed," the Overseer says. "The protocol performed no dispelling sequence. Utilizing parameters derived from the Magium, I suspended local ethereal matter manipulation."

}
#if(v_b3_ch2_name == 2) {
"Request confirmed," the drone states, banking gracefully through the trailing smoke. "Initiating extraction protocol. Note that experimental ethereal procedures remain restricted due to safety protocols governing party 'Barry'. For performance inquiries, consult section 5C-E789 of the Overseer operating manual. Thank you for your cooperation."

"Fine, keep the experimental stuff locked!" I shout. "Just clear the field!"

"Acknowledged. Standard countermeasure deploying in T-minus five seconds. Have a pleasant day."

An emerald pulse washes over the battlefield. In a single clean snap, every tracking fireball dissolves into nothing.

